Scores and prediction are supplied
These are unchanged from Softmax. The loss—not the score function—defines what the learned weights should prefer.

def scores(X, W, b):
    return X @ W + b

def predict(X, W, b):
    return np.argmax(scores(X, W, b), axis=1)

